"LokalBot reads only the folders listed here: pictures and screenshots, PDFs page by page, and documents such as txt, md, rtf, docx, odt and html. It skips hidden folders, app bundles, caches, code projects (except their screenshots), folders that look like datasets, and iCloud files that are not downloaded. With recordings and video included, sound is read 30 seconds at a time and video a frame per shot, so a search can open the moment in LokalBot's player. The index keeps each file's path, its text, and a vector of what it says, shows or sounds like, in the LokalBot library. The image and text model downloads once and runs only while new or changed files are read. Reading pauses while a meeting records, in Low Power Mode, and while the Mac is warm. While you use the Mac, a folder's first read goes at about a third of full speed, and at full speed once you step away. On battery it waits for a charger unless Read big folders on battery is on." = "LokalBot reads only the folders listed here: pictures and screenshots, PDFs page by page, and documents such as txt, md, rtf, docx, odt and html. It skips hidden folders, app bundles, caches, code projects (except their screenshots), folders that look like datasets, and iCloud files that are not downloaded. With recordings and video included, sound is read 30 seconds at a time and video a frame per shot, so a search can open the moment in LokalBot's player. The index keeps each file's path, its text, and a vector of what it says, shows or sounds like, in the LokalBot library. The image and text model downloads once and runs only while new or changed files are read. Reading pauses while a meeting records, in Low Power Mode, and while the Mac is warm. While you use the Mac, a folder's first read goes at about a third of full speed, and at full speed once you step away. On battery it waits for a charger unless Read big folders on battery is on.";
